sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Pipeline as RetrievalPipeline
    participant Dense as DenseRetriever
    participant Sparse as SparseRetriever
    participant Fusion as Hybrid/Score Normalizer
    participant Ranker as Ranker (RRF/Weighted)

    User->>Pipeline: query("What is hybrid retrieval?", top_k=5)

    par Parallel Retrieval
        Pipeline->>Dense: retrieve(query_embedding, top_k=10)
        Dense-->>Pipeline: Dense Candidates (List[RetrievalResult])
    and
        Pipeline->>Sparse: retrieve(query_tokens, top_k=10)
        Sparse-->>Pipeline: Sparse Candidates (List[RetrievalResult])
    end

    Pipeline->>Fusion: merge_results(dense_results, sparse_results)
    note right of Fusion: Score Normalization &<br/>Alpha Blending
    Fusion-->>Pipeline: Merged Results

    Pipeline->>Ranker: rank(Merged Results, top_k=5)
    note right of Ranker: Apply Reciprocal Rank Fusion<br/>or Weights, Sort Descending
    Ranker-->>Pipeline: RankedResultSet (Top 5 Deduped)

    Pipeline-->>User: RankedResultSet
